# Cloudflare Pages headers for examples.jiscribe.dev
# HTML is revalidated on every request; the assets Vite emits with a content
# hash are cached for a day. A hashed name would allow a year, but the shorter
# window bounds how long a bad response can stick around, and `immutable` is
# left off so a reload can always recover.
# Note: Pages concatenates the headers of every matching rule, so /assets/*
# cancels the Cache-Control coming from /* with `!` before setting its own.

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, must-revalidate
